# Who must approve a change (security audit CR-9, 12 Nov 2026; docs/cloud-fixer.md).
# With branch protection "Require review from Code Owners" (and 0 other approvals), a pull request merges without a person
# only when every file it touches has NO owner here. The last matching line wins; a line with no owner clears it.
# GitHub reads this file from main, so a pull request cannot change who must approve it.

# everything is the owner's ...
